{#
  Invitation to somebody who ALREADY has an account here.

  Flat HTML in the style of profile/claim_email.html.twig, for its reasons: no
  layout, no CSS, no images, and the URL printed as well as linked.

  The recipient will be asked to sign in before they can answer, so the email
  says so — otherwise a login page after clicking an invitation looks like the
  first step of a phishing attempt.
#}
<p>Hello,</p>

<p>
  <strong>{{ inviterLabel }}</strong> has invited you to help keep the HMFP Search
  Tool profile for
  <strong>{{ physician.legalName }}{% if physician.credentials is not empty %}, {{ physician.credentials }}{% endif %}</strong>
  up to date.
</p>

<p>
  If you accept, you will be able to propose changes to this profile. A data
  steward reviews every change before it appears in the directory.
</p>

<p>To accept or decline, open this link and sign in with your usual account:</p>

<p><a href="{{ respondUrl }}">{{ respondUrl }}</a></p>

{% if expiresAt %}
  <p>
    This link stops working on
    {{ expiresAt|date('l j F Y') }} at {{ expiresAt|date('g:i A') }}.
  </p>
{% endif %}

<p>
  <strong>If you were not expecting this, please do not accept.</strong>
  Email <a href="mailto:{{ supportEmail }}">{{ supportEmail }}</a> or call
  (617) 278-8162 and let us know.
</p>
